      objective('agreement',limited?'Agree the remaining scope with the team':'Agree scope and separate evidence from assumptions',limited?'Make non-negotiables, remaining choices and the consequences of contrary evidence explicit.':'Use shared evidence to surface assumptions, different interpretations and missing perspectives.','A shared mandate, boundaries and unresolved assumptions.',['workshops','evidence-confidence'])
