      objective('coverage',noUsers?'Plan a feasible route and the user evidence still missing':'Plan participant and situation coverage',noUsers?'Use available sources honestly and identify the direct-user follow-up needed.':issues.has('missing-segments')?'You have recorded a coverage gap. Identify the group or situation whose absence could change the decision.':limited?'Fit coverage and recruitment to the choices the project can still influence.':'Choose relevant users, tasks and situations; explain recruitment and coverage limits.','A workable coverage plan with explicit gaps and follow-up.',noUsers?['existing-evidence','sampling']:['sampling'])
